      "message": "ci(release): the release page is a template - this release's notes, CHANGELOG/issues/Discord links, bug and feature reports, and thanks to its contributors\n\n.github/RELEASE_TEMPLATE.md is filled in by release.yml: the version's\nsection of RELEASE_NOTES.md (never the whole history), links to\nCHANGELOG.md at the tag, the open issues as the roadmap and\nhttps://solidcraft.io/discord, where to report bugs and ask for features,\nand a thank-you list of the GitHub authors of every commit since the\nprevious release tag.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
